*.pptx
*.pdf
!docs/assets/reports/*.pdf
*.patch

# Internal Prompts & Development Audit Folders
audit_TCGA-AA-3864/
audit_reports/
PROJECT_CONTEXT/
CRC_res/
memory/
paper_deliverables/
